pasamurategitim.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/gop_murat-egitim_02.webp\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-35579\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/gaziosmanpasamurategitim.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/gop_murat-egitim_02.webp 600w, https:\/\/gaziosmanpasamurategitim.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/gop_murat-egitim_02-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/gaziosmanpasamurategitim.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/gop_murat-egitim_02-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/gaziosmanpasamurategitim.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/gop_murat-egitim_02-100x100.webp 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-08ccfed e-con-full animated-slow e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"08ccfed\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;ekit--slide-up&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-689e1cc elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-thim-ekits-heading\" data-id=\"689e1cc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"thim-ekits-heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"thim-ekits-heading thim-ekit__heading\"><h2 class=\"title\">Murat E\u011fitim Kurumlar\u0131 <b><i>Gaziosmanpa\u015fa \u015eubesi<\/i><\/b>'ne Ho\u015f Geldiniz<\/h2><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5d6ef87 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5d6ef87\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Murat E\u011fitim Kurumlar\u0131 ailesinin Gaziosmanpa\u015fa&#8217;daki yuvas\u0131na ho\u015f geldiniz. E\u011fitimde m\u00fckemmelli\u011fi hedefleyen kurumumuz, \u00f6\u011frencilerimizin potansiyellerini en \u00fcst seviyeye \u00e7\u0131karmak i\u00e7in tasarlanm\u0131\u015f modern e\u011fitim ortam\u0131 ve uzman kadrosuyla sizlere hizmet vermekten gurur duyar.<\/p><p>Gaziosmanpa\u015fa \u015fubemizde, \u00e7a\u011fda\u015f e\u011fitim anlay\u0131\u015f\u0131m\u0131z ve yenilik\u00e7i yakla\u015f\u0131mlar\u0131m\u0131zla \u00f6\u011frencilerimizin akademik ba\u015far\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 art\u0131r\u0131rken, ki\u015fisel geli\u015fimlerine de katk\u0131 sa\u011fl\u0131yoruz. Her \u00f6\u011frencinin bireysel \u00f6\u011frenme ihtiya\u00e7lar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6z \u00f6n\u00fcnde bulunduran e\u011fitim programlar\u0131m\u0131z, gelece\u011fin liderlerini yeti\u015ftirmek \u00fczere \u00f6zenle haz\u0131rlanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.<\/p><p>Siz de\u011ferli velilerimiz ve \u00f6\u011frencilerimize kap\u0131lar\u0131m\u0131z her zaman a\u00e7\u0131kt\u0131r. Murat E\u011fitim Kurumlar\u0131 Gaziosmanpa\u015fa \u015eubesi olarak, e\u011fitim yolculu\u011funuzda sizlere rehberlik etmekten ve ba\u015far\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131za ortak olmaktan mutluluk duyaca\u011f\u0131z.<!-- notionvc: f06fd33f-ee2e-4dc1-8e7b-9b5e9dc8cbb2 --><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-750120d animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-thim-ekits-button\" data-id=\"750120d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;ekit--slide-up&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"thim-ekits-button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"thim-ekits-button custom-button-hover btn-default\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/gaziosmanpasamurategitim.com.tr\/egitim-felsefemiz\/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\tE\u011fitim Felsefemiz\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-el